<https://www.glossarist.org/dpp/dataset/dpp/concept/dpp-0082>
  a skos:Concept ;
  skos:notation "dpp-0082" ;
  skos:prefLabel "claim"@eng ;
  skos:definition "high-level statement about a characteristic of a product, or about a process or an organization associated with that product (traceable asset). A sustainability claim is a claim that covers one or multiple sustainability dimensions (economic, environmental, social)"@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "In this document “sustainability claims” are referred to as just “claims”."@eng
 .